From: Jonathan Jackson <70459+jjackson@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 14:23:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] Labs mode: one JSON timing line per labs request

LabsAuthFilter wraps every labs request (rejected ones included) and, when it
finishes, logs one INFO line on the labs.request logger:
{"event":"labs_request","endpoint","status","ms","lock_wait_ms",
 "installed","restored","domain","sig"}
restored/installed come from ResponseMetaDataTracker (a restore download, an
app install), lock_wait_ms from LockAspect's wait for the user lock. No username
or token. logging.level.labs.request=INFO so the WARN root does not drop it.
