index 98b33ff8..6f0a005a 100644
--- a/docs/labs-mode.md
+++ b/docs/labs-mode.md
@@ -92,6 +92,22 @@ What formplayer sends to HQ for a labs request:
 * The CCZ comes from `/a/<domain>/apps/api/download_ccz/?app_id=<app_id>&latest=save`. That HQ
   endpoint is unauthenticated.
 
+## Per-request log line
+
+Every labs request (rejected ones included) writes one INFO line on the `labs.request` logger when
+it finishes:
+
+```json
+{"event":"labs_request","endpoint":"/navigate_menu","status":200,"ms":412,"lock_wait_ms":0,"installed":false,"restored":true,"domain":"my-domain","sig":"v2"}
+```
+
+`ms` is the whole request inside formplayer; `lock_wait_ms` the time spent waiting for the user's
+lock; `restored` that it downloaded a restore from HQ; `installed` that it installed an app; `sig`
+the signature scheme the request was signed with, `v1` or `v2`, on rejected requests too (a 401
+with `"sig":"v2"` is a v2 request that failed verification; `null` if rejected before the
+signature was looked at). No username or token is
+ever logged. `logging.level.labs.request=INFO` is set in `application.properties` (root is WARN).
+
 ## Which `app_id` to send
 
 Send the **released build id**, not Connect's `cc_app_id` (the master app id). Formplayer caches
